*Seaside-Aria-Core
ariaScrollbar
	"Role.  https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA/Reference/Roles/scrollbar_role

	required to set 
		#ariaControls:
		#ariaValueNow: 

	optionally can set 
		#ariaValueMax: 
		#ariaValueMin:
		#ariaValueText:
		#ariaLabelledBy:
		#ariaLabel: 
		#ariaOrientation: 
	"
	self role:'scrollbar'